; The agent FASTLANE: the standalone mechanism behind `fennec dev --agent` / `--attach`. ONE generic
; core (the verdict journal + the hook protocol an editing agent reads after each edit) and ONE
; declarative adapter per coding harness (Claude Code, Codex, Mistral Vibe). Self-contained and
; dev-only — linked into the `fennec` CLI, never installed/promoted as its own package. The dev
; supervisor (fennec_dev) and the CLI plug in through this lib; nothing here depends back on them.
(library
 (name fennec_fastlane)
 (libraries unix yojson digestif fennec-paw fennec-hunt.unit)
 (inline_tests
  (backend fennec-hunt.runner))
 (preprocess
  (pps fennec-hunt.ppx)))
